OL,3,GNEWSAMLAs clash over sex offender
OL,4,AJeffrey Donaldson
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein has challenged the Democratic
OL,7,FUnionist Party (DUP) over "unanswered
OL,8,Fquestions" after Jeffrey Donaldson was
OL,9,Fjailed last week for a series of child
OL,10,Fsex crimes.
OL,12,FThe former DUP leader was given a
OL,13,F15-year jail sentence after he was
OL,14,Fconvicted of 18 child sex offences,
OL,15,Fincluding one count of rape, against
OL,16,Ftwo young girls.
OL,18,FThe case was raised by Sinn Fein during
OL,19,Fa matter of the day debate in the
OL,20,FAssembly chamber.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
